This repository contains Apache-2.0 licensed code for the blink runtime,
demo, training utilities, and evaluation utilities.

The model weights are not included. The public Hugging Face model
repositories state their own weight license: non-commercial research and
evaluation.

Attributions:
- SemIf: blink uses the fixed "semif" JSON prompt format from the open SemIf
  project for rendering typed decisions.
- Qwen base models: blink-4b and blink-27b are based on public Qwen models
  whose model cards declare Apache-2.0 licensing.
- MiMo base model: blink-mimo-9b is based on XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.6-Distill-Qwen-9B,
  whose model card declares MIT licensing for the base model.
- Contributor Covenant: CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md is based on Contributor Covenant 2.1.

Dataset licenses are listed in the model cards at https://huggingface.co/thegovind.
